<title>POLAND: Swarzedz signs DM 200 mln German deal.</title>
<headline>Swarzedz signs DM 200 mln German deal.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish furniture producer Swarzedz SA signed a contract on producing furniture worth 200 million marks until 2002 for Germany's International Moebelhandelskantor Gmbh &amp; Co KH (IMK), Swarzedz said.</p>
<p>It said in a statement, that according to the deal, Swarzedz would supply IMK, a part of Schieder Group, with furniture worth 32 million marks every year.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
